{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve included JSON nulls**\n\nThis conflates an actual `null` value with excluded, unavailable, or transform-failed content. Consequently a successful handler returning `null` omits `output`, and an opted-in result transform returning `null` cannot emit JSON null. Track presence separately from value\u2014including transform success\u2014and have the wire maps emit `null` when present while omitting only disabled or unavailable fields. Add null input/output/result tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7sNF5W","finding_digest":"7222336e2d78db6abd6301708845ad1644039532304641747c6281929560f9e7","finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","finding_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","identity_key":"insight-plugin/workflowinsight.java::applydatacontent::explicit-null-preservation","line":385,"observation_digest":"1fe23ac5d46f168a6b6986dea3ba80427e97549da6704f84791e7a6d9fc0752a","observation_id":"aro_v1_d7rdvroun4liu23jq3pkhouaij","path":"insight-plugin/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/insight/WorkflowInsight.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_oirdg3rnpdnwvpldafyiqrnncz","published_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:01Z","review_id":"arr_v1_2uiyk56mbx65mvlox4bqoub2i7","reviewed_base_sha":"a28d2262c18a8a1f1b7cc7296cf2bfd166e6ca94","reviewed_head_sha":"fe682327e1d3a6d0b6defad4684bab8d594438b5","reviewer":"codex","start_line":384,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":661},"record_id":"art_v1_e5dtaywhshrskqkzl4wu27zs2w","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-08T22:32:01Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
